</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_OpenStax/10.E:_Liquids_and_Solids_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_72"><span id="Q10.3.17"></span><h3 id="Q10.3.17-42535">Q10.3.17</h3>

