</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_OpenStax/10.E:_Liquids_and_Solids_(Exercises)" class="mt-section"><span id="S10.3.24"></span><h3 id="S10.3.24-42535">S10.3.24 </h3>

