<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_OpenStax/10.E:_Liquids_and_Solids_(Exercises)" class="mt-section"><span id="Q10.4.1"></span><h3 id="Q10.4.1-42535">Q10.4.1</h3>

